WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
There is no more serious danger to our planet today

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.040
than the most powerful and destructive weapons

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.280
ever devised by man,

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:12.040
of which the United States, as you know, has many.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.840
Just as I did in my first term,

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.040
I've made containing these threats a top priority.

